{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.32:0.4"], "en": "The Verse of the Elder Suppiya:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.32:1.1"], "en": "“By one who is aging, [seeking] the ageless;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
